{
  "id": "express-basements-classic",
  "description": "The Classic tower-one at four stars sells the eleven condos in one column from floor 2 to 14 (an elevator never runs through a room) and builds an express shaft there from B4 up into the tower: it stops at every basement floor it passes and, above ground, only at the lobbies. A basement stop is turned off, survives a save round trip, and is turned back on; the shaft is then shortened to B2 and extended back down to B6, stopping at each basement it now passes, and a last round trip keeps it all.",
